        "body": "Given below are two statements: one is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).\nAssertion (A): Management cannot be seen, but its presence can be felt in the way the organisation functions.\nReason (R): The effect of management is noticeable in an organisation where targets are met according to plans, employees are happy and satisfied, and there is orderliness instead of chaos.\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below:",
